    "detailed_description": "This is a minimalist arcade game about a rabbit collecting flowers on a lawn. The time for collecting is limited, and each flower collected adds seconds to your timer. The game ends once the timer runs out. Beware of obstacles and bottomless chasms. Use your stamina to run and climb high platforms as flowers appear in different places, and keep an eye on the remaining time. And the arrow will show you the way to the nearest goal.",
